{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HEB","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"希伯来书","commonName":"希伯来书","title":"希伯来书","order":58,"numberOfChapters":13,"sha256":"88dfe968124b22760b2021a1ff05966bca10f085ce6d6eeba0253dacf63dd9ff","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HEB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":13,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HEB/13.json","totalNumberOfVerses":301},"chapter":{"number":5,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["凡从人间选出来的大祭司，都是受委任代表人办理与上帝有关的事，为人的罪向上帝献上礼物和赎罪祭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["他能体谅那些无知和迷失的人，因为他自己也受制于人性的软弱。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["所以，他不但要为众人的罪献祭，也要为自己的罪献祭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["没有人能自取这大祭司的尊荣，只有像亚伦一样蒙上帝呼召的人才可以做大祭司。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["同样，基督也没有自取荣耀做大祭司，是上帝对祂说：",{"text":"“你是我的儿子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我今日成为你父亲。”","poem":1},{"noteId":18}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["在圣经的另一处，上帝又说：",{"text":"“你照麦基洗德的模式永远做祭司。”","poem":1},{"noteId":19}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["基督在世为人的时候，曾经声泪俱下地祈求能救祂脱离死亡的上帝。祂因为敬虔而蒙了应允。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["基督虽然是上帝的儿子，仍然从所受的苦难中学习了顺服。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["祂既然达到了纯全的地步，就成了所有顺服祂的人得到永恒救恩的源头，"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["并且被上帝照麦基洗德的模式立为大祭司。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["信徒要长进"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["关于这方面的事，我们还有很多话要说，但因为你们已经听不进去，很难向你们解释。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["按你们学习的时间来算，你们本该做别人的老师了，可惜你们还需要别人向你们传授上帝话语的基本道理，成了不能吃干粮、只能吃奶的人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["因为只能吃奶的人还是婴孩，不熟习公义之道。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["干粮是给成年人吃的，他们的心思历经锻炼，能够分辨善恶。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":18,"caller":"+","text":"诗篇2:7。","reference":{"chapter":5,"verse":5}},{"noteId":19,"caller":"+","text":"诗篇110:4。","reference":{"chapter":5,"verse":6}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HEB/5.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HEB/6.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HEB/4.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}